0..73 Comment "// A cell introduced with a value on the face it is fixed on violates its"
74..148 Comment "// boundary: the boundary law and β at that point rewrite one term to two"
149..227 Comment "// normal forms, a variable and `zero()`, no rule the path order orients joins"
228..301 Comment "// them, and the block\'s rules are refused by name. The extension type of"
302..380 Comment "// `../../model/extension/zero-fiber.gandr` introduces a cell by its value off"
381..406 Comment "// the face alone (#641)."
408..483 Comment "/// `ins` takes the cell\'s value at both points, so `outp(ins(x, y))` reads"
484..532 Comment "/// `zero` by the boundary and `x` by β (#641)."
